WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:57.040 --> 01:57.960
Uncle Luo?

01:58.560 --> 01:59.400
When did you get here?

02:00.000 --> 02:01.880
You can finally come in.

02:02.840 --> 02:05.000
Since His Majesty lifted your confinement,

02:05.080 --> 02:09.039
I've been waiting
for justice to finally come.

02:10.919 --> 02:12.520
Justice won't just show up.

02:13.200 --> 02:14.120
You have to fight for it.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.680
That's the Prince of Duan's daughter
for you.

02:18.920 --> 02:19.960
Here.

02:22.200 --> 02:25.520
I was worried
you'd be tied down by finery,

02:25.600 --> 02:28.000
a marriage contract,
and a princess's title,

02:28.080 --> 02:29.040
unable to move.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.840
If that could bind me,

02:33.360 --> 02:35.000
I'd have died countless times by now.

02:35.760 --> 02:38.280
I stay alive for revenge.

02:39.480 --> 02:40.440
Then,

02:41.000 --> 02:43.920
we should pay respects
to the Prince of Duan's spirit.

02:46.440 --> 02:49.800
I won't drink it
until I kill the enemy myself.

02:52.880 --> 02:53.800
What's your plan?

02:54.480 --> 02:58.120
If His Majesty won't name him,
we'll make him show himself.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.600
With just you,

03:01.320 --> 03:04.200
I'm afraid you can't bring him down.

03:04.800 --> 03:06.040
It's enough.

03:06.560 --> 03:07.400
What do you need me to do?

03:08.280 --> 03:09.240
Keep the house safe for me.

03:16.280 --> 03:18.200
I've been tracking
Lv Chongshan's whereabouts,

03:18.280 --> 03:20.080
but he's extremely cautious.

03:20.160 --> 03:21.800
He hasn't shown up
in Western capital so far.

03:21.880 --> 03:23.400
This time is different.

03:23.480 --> 03:25.920
His master has already been exposed
before His Majesty.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.040
His master will need a scapegoat.

03:27.120 --> 03:28.560
If we use that as bait,

03:28.640 --> 03:31.360
we might lure him out.

03:35.680 --> 03:37.600
But your wedding
to Princess Yong'an is near.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.000
Why move now?

03:44.280 --> 03:46.720
She's carried that hatred
all alone for 15 years.

03:47.920 --> 03:50.600
I want to settle the past for her
before the wedding,

03:50.680 --> 03:53.480
so she can live a different life.

03:54.560 --> 03:55.640
Mr. Xiao,

03:56.160 --> 03:57.920
that's the mark of a true man.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.080
I'll help you.

03:59.880 --> 04:00.880
Thanks, Mr. Gu.

04:03.520 --> 04:04.600
Over here.

04:08.480 --> 04:09.440
Wipe it clean.

04:16.279 --> 04:18.040
Your Highness, come pick the table skirts.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.920
Then we'll taste dishes and pick wine.

04:20.519 --> 04:21.680
The invitations are out?

04:21.760 --> 04:23.760
Yes, to every address on the list.

04:24.440 --> 04:25.440
Has everyone confirmed their attendance?

04:25.520 --> 04:28.360
In Consort Shu's name,
no one dares to skip it.

04:29.760 --> 04:32.960
Your Highness,
pick the pastries and sweets too.

04:33.040 --> 04:35.240
As for the seating, I made a quick list.

04:35.320 --> 04:36.720
Did I miss anything?

04:37.760 --> 04:39.920
Other than the wine,
you can decide everything.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.560
What wine are we using?

04:43.160 --> 04:44.120
Gentleman Wine.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.480
How come I've never heard of it?

04:47.640 --> 04:48.800
You'll know tomorrow night.

04:52.120 --> 04:53.360
Mr. Xiao!

04:55.200 --> 04:57.360
Mr. Xiao, your trick really is smart.

04:57.880 --> 04:59.720
After we spread the word
about the high bounty

04:59.800 --> 05:01.080
on Lv Chongshan's head,

05:01.160 --> 05:02.360
he couldn't sit still.

05:02.440 --> 05:04.800
He thinks his master
is making him the scapegoat.

05:04.880 --> 05:06.720
He's searching everywhere
for help escaping the capital.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.960
When can we see him?

05:08.560 --> 05:11.560
The snakehead will meet him
tomorrow night in the woods by the ferry.

05:13.880 --> 05:16.120
Compared to us, he fears his master more.

05:16.200 --> 05:18.720
Once we catch him,
we should get the man behind it.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.240
You really won't tell Princess Yong'an?

05:25.600 --> 05:27.040
Tomorrow she's hosting
a banquet at her manor.

05:27.120 --> 05:28.440
No need to worry her.

05:28.520 --> 05:30.640
We'll tell her when it's done.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.080
Alright.

05:32.160 --> 05:34.040
I'll pose as the snakehead
and meet him tomorrow night.

05:35.600 --> 05:36.880
I can't fight.

05:36.960 --> 05:38.120
Let me pose as the snakehead,

05:38.200 --> 05:39.360
and you cover me from the shadows.

05:39.440 --> 05:41.960
He'll be on guard with me,
so you strike when you can.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.320
Alright.

05:57.160 --> 05:59.360
GRACEFUL VIRTUE, TIMELY RAINS

06:05.840 --> 06:06.680
What are you thinking about?

06:07.760 --> 06:09.080
Tonight's banquet.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.560
It's rare to see you put thought
into this kind of thing.

06:13.480 --> 06:16.840
I hope after tonight,
everything will be different.

06:17.440 --> 06:18.440
What's so different about this banquet?

06:19.320 --> 06:22.440
After the banquet, I'll be wed to you.

06:28.960 --> 06:32.360
I hope after tonight,
everything will be different.

06:32.960 --> 06:34.880
After the banquet, I'll come see you.

06:35.640 --> 06:36.480
You're busy tonight?

06:37.560 --> 06:38.440
I'm on duty at the Astronomical Bureau.

06:39.760 --> 06:41.000
Then focus on your shift.

06:41.080 --> 06:42.680
Tomorrow morning is fine too.

06:43.840 --> 06:44.960
Wait for me.

07:12.160 --> 07:13.480
We can't ride any farther.

07:13.560 --> 07:15.520
Lv Chongshan is running for his life.

07:15.600 --> 07:16.600
He won't make a move so easily.

07:16.680 --> 07:19.200
All we need to do
is follow the snakehead's plan,

07:19.280 --> 07:20.120
win his trust,

07:20.200 --> 07:22.600
get him onto our boat, and it's done.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.760
Relax.

07:24.560 --> 07:27.440
I'll circle behind him, so you'll be safe.

07:29.040 --> 07:29.880
It's almost time.

07:29.960 --> 07:31.080
Let's go.

07:35.960 --> 07:41.560
PROPITIOUS WINDS AND NOURISHING RAINS

07:47.440 --> 07:48.880
No need to be formal, everyone.

07:48.960 --> 07:51.400
Fruit and pastries, wine and dishes,

07:51.480 --> 07:52.520
help yourselves.

07:55.080 --> 07:57.200
This wine tastes so unusual.

07:57.280 --> 07:58.360
I've never had it before.

07:59.320 --> 08:00.280
What wine is this?

08:00.360 --> 08:01.760
It's Gentleman Wine,

08:01.840 --> 08:04.360
specially prepared
by Princess Yong'an for everyone.

08:04.440 --> 08:06.840
Why only Gentleman Wine?

08:06.920 --> 08:08.560
Where's the Lady Wine?

08:11.080 --> 08:13.760
Lady Wine is for a gentleman to win over.

08:16.640 --> 08:18.560
This taste is really something.

08:18.640 --> 08:21.320
There's a beech-mushroom aroma.

08:22.520 --> 08:23.960
Sir, you have fine taste.

08:24.040 --> 08:26.680
In this wine, we added
beech mushrooms and matsutake,

08:26.760 --> 08:29.880
so in late autumn,
you can still taste fresh mushrooms.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.280
EAST

09:37.000 --> 09:37.800
Tonight!

09:39.240 --> 09:40.280
Where's the money?

10:44.400 --> 10:45.480
It's you?

10:45.560 --> 10:46.480
It's you?

10:46.560 --> 10:49.560
Something felt off about the snakehead…

10:53.640 --> 10:54.720
Mr. Xiao?

10:54.800 --> 10:56.040
I got word

10:56.120 --> 10:58.000
Lv Chongshan would meet
the snakehead today

10:58.080 --> 10:59.360
and slip out of the capital.

10:59.440 --> 11:01.040
So Mr. Xiao and I posed
as the snakehead to meet him.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.720
Once we caught him,
we'd find the one behind it.

11:03.800 --> 11:06.480
I heard Lv Chongshan's master
sent plenty of spies to find him,

11:06.560 --> 11:08.480
so I posed as Lv Chongshan
and met with the spies.

11:08.560 --> 11:10.720
If we caught a spy, we'd find his master.

11:11.760 --> 11:12.960
Who knew it'd be you two.

11:14.160 --> 11:15.080
We've been tricked.

11:15.800 --> 11:17.480
Oh no. It's the boss.

11:17.560 --> 11:18.880
She lured us to the outskirts on purpose.

11:21.840 --> 11:25.520
The Prince of Duan's manor
may be short on people,

11:25.600 --> 11:27.600
but Her Highness
should still receive her guests.

11:28.120 --> 11:31.320
Sir, this is the Princess's Mansion now.

11:31.400 --> 11:33.560
She's the lady of the house
and a bride-to-be.

11:33.640 --> 11:35.800
Her attention is quite divided.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.760
The Right Chancellor is here!

11:43.320 --> 11:44.560
Right Chancellor!

11:53.240 --> 11:55.360
Good. Sit, everyone.

12:10.600 --> 12:12.440
Why are you all staring at me,

12:12.520 --> 12:14.560
like I'm the host or something?

12:15.080 --> 12:16.000
Where's Peiyi?

12:20.080 --> 12:21.520
Look at me, so impatient.

12:22.320 --> 12:25.080
I still think of her
as the child raised by my sister.

12:25.680 --> 12:28.520
I actually forgot
she's a titled princess now!

12:32.880 --> 12:33.720
Everyone,

12:34.480 --> 12:37.280
you've heard the music and had the wine.

12:37.880 --> 12:40.120
When will Her Highness show herself?

12:41.960 --> 12:43.680
Princess Yong'an, Li Peiyi,

12:43.760 --> 12:45.680
thank you for coming to my banquet.

12:50.720 --> 12:52.800
I have three cups to share with you all.

12:52.880 --> 12:54.200
There are three toasts tonight.

12:56.000 --> 12:58.200
First, to my rebirth.

12:58.280 --> 13:00.720
May I be blessed
after surviving the disaster.

13:00.800 --> 13:02.520
Everyone, please.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.120
Please.

13:19.480 --> 13:20.320
There she is!

13:22.600 --> 13:23.560
Where?

13:23.640 --> 13:25.960
The banquet just started.

13:26.040 --> 13:27.640
You're seeing things already.

13:28.880 --> 13:31.680
Second, to my return
to the Prince of Duan's manor.

13:31.760 --> 13:34.200
It's a move-in and a homecoming.

13:35.560 --> 13:37.920
May we all regain what we've lost.

13:38.000 --> 13:38.880
Please.

13:43.160 --> 13:45.840
Third, I want to see an old acquaintance

13:46.360 --> 13:48.160
and recount an old story.

13:49.240 --> 13:51.640
I hope to fulfill a long-held wish.

13:52.160 --> 13:54.000
You may feel dizzy and unwell,

13:54.080 --> 13:56.240
and your body may not obey you.

13:56.760 --> 13:57.880
Don't worry.

13:58.400 --> 14:00.000
It's just the effects of toxic mushrooms.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.880
The wine is poisoned!

14:06.240 --> 14:07.240
Your Highness…

14:07.760 --> 14:08.960
We have no grudge with you.

14:09.040 --> 14:11.000
Why poison the wine?

14:11.080 --> 14:12.880
- Why harm us?
- Any grudge or not?

14:12.960 --> 14:14.640
You'll know soon.

14:14.720 --> 14:16.520
These toxic mushrooms are fierce,

14:16.600 --> 14:18.360
but they won't kill you.

14:18.440 --> 14:20.200
So be patient,

14:20.720 --> 14:22.920
and hear me out.

14:23.440 --> 14:25.360
- If I'm in a good mood,
- You…

14:25.440 --> 14:26.520
I might hand you the antidote.

14:26.600 --> 14:28.680
If you want revenge, go for the right man.

14:28.760 --> 14:30.720
You poisoned us for nothing,

14:30.800 --> 14:33.120
and now you want us to hear your story?

14:33.640 --> 14:35.840
Don't think just because you're a princess

14:35.920 --> 14:37.960
you can do whatever you want!

14:38.040 --> 14:38.960
Enough noise!

14:40.240 --> 14:43.360
Good. Then I'll start my story.

14:43.880 --> 14:45.840
What I'm about to tell
is what happened 15 years ago,

14:45.920 --> 14:48.120
when the Prince of Duan's household
was wiped out.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.600
I'm sure you've all heard of it.

14:50.560 --> 14:53.200
But I have a different version.

14:53.280 --> 14:54.120
GRACEFUL VIRTUE, TIMELY RAINS

14:54.200 --> 14:56.600
- Lantern Festival night, 15 years ago.
- My good girl.

14:56.680 --> 14:58.360
- It was right here.
- Come, your turn.

14:58.440 --> 15:00.040
My father, my mother, and I

15:00.120 --> 15:02.000
- watched the moon and painted lanterns.
- Let me see.

15:02.080 --> 15:03.320
So pretty!

15:03.400 --> 15:04.960
- The lantern burned me.
- It hurts!

15:06.480 --> 15:08.120
Mother carried me back to my room.

15:08.920 --> 15:10.560
Here, take your medicine.

15:24.440 --> 15:26.680
I took a pill and fell asleep.

15:26.760 --> 15:28.160
When I woke again,

15:28.960 --> 15:31.880
all I heard was screaming outside
and the sounds of fighting.

15:38.360 --> 15:40.840
I don't know how long
the slaughter lasted.

15:41.560 --> 15:43.560
Everywhere I looked was blood.

15:44.160 --> 15:46.600
Screams rang in my ears.

15:47.120 --> 15:49.640
That year, I was only eight.

15:50.840 --> 15:53.520
And I may have seen
more dead bodies than you will

15:53.600 --> 15:55.000
in your whole lives!

15:56.160 --> 15:58.840
By day, they were all living,
breathing people,

15:58.920 --> 16:00.280
playing with me.

16:01.400 --> 16:03.360
Among the dead

16:03.440 --> 16:05.840
were my father and mother.

16:05.920 --> 16:09.080
I know the one behind all this

16:09.160 --> 16:10.680
is among you.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.280
He hid it well.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.360
I searched for 15 years
and couldn't find him.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.320
So I made a decision.

16:16.400 --> 16:19.160
I'll kill you all.

16:20.600 --> 16:21.520
- Oh my!
- Murder! Run!

16:21.600 --> 16:22.560
Princess Yong'an is going to kill us!

16:23.600 --> 16:24.440
The Princess is killing!

16:24.520 --> 16:25.800
Murder!

16:29.680 --> 16:30.520
Let's run!

16:41.400 --> 16:43.920
So it was you, Right Chancellor.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.120
For 15 years,

16:46.840 --> 16:48.360
you made me search so hard.

16:49.080 --> 16:50.640
You hid it so well.

16:51.640 --> 16:52.720
Your Highness,

16:53.320 --> 16:56.200
I can't make sense of what you're saying.

16:56.280 --> 16:58.800
Everyone's been poisoned,

16:58.880 --> 17:00.960
crashing about like mindless insects.

17:01.040 --> 17:05.480
But only one person
felt guilty and was scared.

17:15.000 --> 17:17.079
He knew I wouldn't let it go,

17:18.920 --> 17:21.400
so he wouldn't touch a thing here.

17:21.480 --> 17:24.119
He knew the one way to get out fast.

17:24.200 --> 17:25.760
He knows this place best,

17:26.480 --> 17:29.160
because this is where he killed my father.

17:29.240 --> 17:31.920
And 15 years ago, he slipped away unseen

17:32.000 --> 17:33.920
from this very exit of this manor.

17:36.520 --> 17:37.440
Too bad.

17:37.520 --> 17:39.280
I've blocked the door.

17:40.720 --> 17:43.560
Today, you won't escape.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.480
Your Highness,

17:47.400 --> 17:49.480
you've handled cases for years.

17:49.560 --> 17:53.000
Don't you know convictions need evidence?

17:53.080 --> 17:55.920
You poisoned your own guests,

17:56.680 --> 17:58.320
and that's your crime.

18:00.640 --> 18:04.360
I didn't fall for your trap,
and that's my caution.

18:05.240 --> 18:07.560
I don't drink. That's no crime.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.840
You come at me with a blade.

18:09.920 --> 18:10.920
If I turn to run,

18:11.520 --> 18:13.040
that's not a crime either.

18:13.120 --> 18:15.480
Your scary little tale

18:16.240 --> 18:19.880
is just slander, utterly unconvincing!

18:21.400 --> 18:23.160
I don't need to convict you.

18:24.760 --> 18:26.120
I only need your life!

18:35.680 --> 18:37.280
Li Peiyi,

18:37.800 --> 18:41.240
you think I'd come unprepared
to your family banquet?

18:42.000 --> 18:44.840
Even if you didn't strike tonight,

18:44.920 --> 18:48.200
I'd still make sure you die
without a body left whole.

18:55.040 --> 18:56.200
Your Highness, I'm here!

18:56.280 --> 18:58.480
Tonight we'll avenge the Prince of Duan!

19:02.760 --> 19:04.840
The Jianning Iron Army
still has survivors?

19:06.080 --> 19:08.360
Back then, you couldn't protect
the Prince of Duan.

19:08.440 --> 19:09.400
Today you'll fail again!

19:21.000 --> 19:22.240
Uncle Luo!

19:36.960 --> 19:39.560
Back then, the Prince of Duan
died right here!

19:40.160 --> 19:42.880
Today, you can go join him!

20:04.160 --> 20:05.480
Well done!

20:05.560 --> 20:07.160
Well done!

20:07.240 --> 20:09.720
Much more interesting
than your simple-minded father.

20:09.800 --> 20:14.200
He knew I came
under imperial order to arrest him,

20:14.280 --> 20:18.040
yet he still hoped to see His Majesty.

20:20.120 --> 20:21.400
He missed his chance,

20:21.480 --> 20:23.560
and my men pinned him to his knees!

20:27.360 --> 20:30.920
I barely had to swing my sword,

20:31.000 --> 20:33.040
and he was dead.

20:35.600 --> 20:36.840
You dared kill a prince.

20:37.800 --> 20:39.240
Your crime deserves death!

20:43.800 --> 20:46.960
The Palace Investigation Bureau ruled
the Prince of Duan died by his own hand!

20:48.440 --> 20:50.360
After all, the blade that killed him

20:50.440 --> 20:52.480
was found in his own hand!

20:55.840 --> 20:57.040
Don't worry.

20:57.120 --> 20:59.080
I'll spin you a fine story too.

20:59.600 --> 21:02.360
I'll report it to His Majesty
and spread it across the court!

21:03.000 --> 21:06.080
Let's see who lives
to tell the story to His Majesty.

21:06.160 --> 21:07.640
Then bring it on!

21:07.720 --> 21:08.960
I'm curious too.

21:28.480 --> 21:29.360
Lv Chongshan!

22:43.840 --> 22:44.880
Your Highness!

23:03.480 --> 23:04.640
Du Zhixing

23:04.720 --> 23:08.040
is not much of a teacher.

23:08.640 --> 23:10.120
Fifteen years,

23:10.720 --> 23:12.120
and is that all he taught you?

23:14.720 --> 23:15.760
Like him.

23:16.960 --> 23:17.960
Exactly like him.

23:18.880 --> 23:22.040
For 15 years, every sight of you

23:22.680 --> 23:25.080
brings back your father's eyes.

23:25.880 --> 23:27.840
He always stared at me just so.

23:29.320 --> 23:30.920
That look…

23:31.720 --> 23:32.920
of contempt…

23:33.800 --> 23:35.320
of anger…

23:37.840 --> 23:38.960
and of righteous fury.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.560
He provoked me.

23:41.640 --> 23:43.520
A martial upstart,

23:43.600 --> 23:46.160
meddling in army funds and corruption.

23:46.760 --> 23:50.320
Leaning on his title as a prince
and his war merits,

23:50.400 --> 23:53.360
he thought he could shake my foundation.

23:53.960 --> 23:57.360
But in the end, the heavens sided with me.

23:58.320 --> 24:00.360
"Mars invades the Heart."

24:05.080 --> 24:07.160
A perfect omen to frame him!

24:07.240 --> 24:11.520
The stars played their part
to lend me a hand.

24:11.600 --> 24:14.720
Everything lined up.

24:15.240 --> 24:17.080
So you see, I didn't murder him.

24:18.320 --> 24:22.520
It was fate taking its course.

24:24.520 --> 24:26.600
Now it's your turn.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.600
You'll die

24:29.680 --> 24:33.040
on the very stones
your father's blood stained.

24:33.720 --> 24:38.640
Isn't that a family reunion?

24:56.160 --> 24:58.000
Kill her! Kill her!

25:34.280 --> 25:35.600
Your Highness!

25:41.240 --> 25:43.040
You've always been a man of few words.

25:43.120 --> 25:45.560
But once people get smug, they slip.

25:45.640 --> 25:48.880
You must regret having said so much to me.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.520
Any backup?

25:54.640 --> 25:56.520
If not, kneel down,

25:57.040 --> 25:58.600
and let me take your life.

26:02.080 --> 26:02.920
Peiyi!

26:04.600 --> 26:06.320
Deputy Director Xiao, you're just in time.

26:06.400 --> 26:08.200
Look, Princess Yong'an has gone mad.

26:08.280 --> 26:10.160
She killed everyone.

26:10.240 --> 26:11.800
- She has the Prince of Duan's madness--
- Shut up!

26:14.280 --> 26:16.120
You're too weak to lift a thing.

26:16.720 --> 26:19.040
He's a Deputy Director
who can't throw a punch.

26:20.640 --> 26:22.200
Who can stop a madwoman?

26:25.440 --> 26:26.760
Peiyi.

26:28.800 --> 26:29.640
Put the sword down.

26:29.720 --> 26:30.720
Kill him!

26:30.800 --> 26:31.760
No!

26:32.680 --> 26:33.880
You're trying to stop me
from getting revenge?

26:36.000 --> 26:37.040
No.

26:37.880 --> 26:39.440
I'm stopping you
from doing the wrong thing.

26:40.040 --> 26:43.040
Cutting down my enemy, how is that wrong?

26:43.880 --> 26:45.280
He's a court official.

26:45.800 --> 26:47.720
Every guest tonight is a witness.

26:48.520 --> 26:51.160
If you kill him, you wouldn't survive it.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.880
Do you smell it?

27:01.880 --> 27:03.120
What?

27:05.040 --> 27:05.880
The smell of blood.

27:09.280 --> 27:11.040
Whenever I have nightmares,

27:12.600 --> 27:14.120
I smell that same blood.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.720
Once I kill him,

27:21.200 --> 27:22.760
my nightmares will end.

27:25.120 --> 27:27.400
That smell won't scare me anymore.

27:27.480 --> 27:29.240
It'll be the taste of my revenge!

27:29.320 --> 27:31.440
But I'm afraid you'll have new nightmares.

27:31.520 --> 27:34.000
I'm afraid he'll drag you down to hell.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.960
I'm not afraid of hell,

27:39.200 --> 27:40.720
as long as he goes with me.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.680
Peiyi!

27:51.000 --> 27:52.560
Her Highness shouldn't dirty her hands.

27:52.640 --> 27:55.200
- Let me do it!
- No!

27:56.040 --> 27:57.080
You…

27:57.960 --> 27:59.720
That old bastard confessed it himself.

27:59.800 --> 28:00.880
It was him.

28:00.960 --> 28:03.200
He framed the Prince of Duan
with that star nonsense.

28:03.280 --> 28:05.920
He deliberately stopped the Prince of Duan
from seeing His Majesty.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.880
He forged the charge
that the Prince of Duan

28:06.960 --> 28:07.840
defied an imperial order!

28:07.920 --> 28:10.400
He killed an imperial prince
with his own hands!

28:10.480 --> 28:13.520
His guilt is clear.
Killing him isn't wrong!

28:14.880 --> 28:16.680
It took me 15 years…

28:18.920 --> 28:20.120
to remember that part.

28:23.840 --> 28:25.280
I risked my life

28:26.240 --> 28:28.320
to force out the man
who slaughtered my whole family.

28:31.440 --> 28:33.200
If I can't kill him,

28:34.080 --> 28:37.760
why didn't you let me die clueless
15 years ago?

28:40.000 --> 28:41.000
Peiyi.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.000
I'll go with you to see His Majesty.

28:44.640 --> 28:47.080
Now that Cui Minzhong
has confessed to every crime,

28:47.720 --> 28:49.760
His Majesty will give you justice.

28:49.840 --> 28:51.880
Tang law will give you justice.

28:52.480 --> 28:53.920
If he dies here,

28:54.840 --> 28:55.840
then there's no proof left.

28:55.920 --> 28:58.360
The Prince of Duan's name
will never be cleared.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.800
Deputy Director Xiao,
you're the one with a clear head.

29:02.880 --> 29:05.280
I'll tell His Majesty everything.

29:05.360 --> 29:07.240
- Take me to His Majesty!
- You…

29:10.800 --> 29:11.640
Peiyi.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.520
Your Highness!

29:13.600 --> 29:15.960
We waited 15 years.

29:16.040 --> 29:17.600
Are we really letting him off that easily?

29:17.680 --> 29:19.040
We're not letting him off!

29:24.400 --> 29:25.320
Peiyi,

29:26.520 --> 29:28.520
if you kill him now,
it's letting him off easy.

29:29.480 --> 29:31.800
He must confess before His Majesty
to every charge.

29:32.920 --> 29:36.520
He must confess before the whole realm
and give the Prince of Duan his justice.

29:37.600 --> 29:39.640
Search carefully!
Don't let a single one escape!

29:43.080 --> 29:45.600
The Imperial Guard can't find you here.
Leave, now.

29:45.680 --> 29:46.880
- You…
- Leave, now!

29:46.960 --> 29:50.080
- Help! Someone!
- Run!

29:50.160 --> 29:51.240
- Help!
- Leave now!

29:52.840 --> 29:53.720
Help!

29:56.320 --> 29:57.440
Peiyi!

29:58.400 --> 29:59.880
- Peiyi!
- Your Highness!

30:20.960 --> 30:22.640
Cui Minzhong slaughtered
the Prince of Duan's household

30:22.720 --> 30:23.880
15 years ago!

30:23.960 --> 30:26.040
Now he tried to kill Princess Yong'an.

30:26.120 --> 30:28.560
Take him into the palace
and report to His Majesty!

30:29.400 --> 30:31.360
And Lv Chongshan's body, take it as well.

30:31.440 --> 30:32.360
Understood.

30:37.760 --> 30:39.120
Let go of me!

30:39.960 --> 30:42.320
You're escorting me to see His Majesty!

30:42.400 --> 30:43.560
Do you even understand?

30:56.360 --> 30:57.520
Cui Minzhong!

30:57.600 --> 30:59.360
How dare you!

30:59.440 --> 31:01.880
You used even me, deceived me!

31:54.480 --> 31:57.320
She's badly hurt,
but her life isn't in danger.

31:57.400 --> 31:58.480
Let me check on her.

31:59.680 --> 32:00.640
Let her rest properly.

32:03.160 --> 32:04.240
Let's go.

32:27.920 --> 32:31.720
THREE DAYS LATER

32:35.840 --> 32:36.800
Look at you.

32:37.480 --> 32:39.120
So gloomy again.

32:39.720 --> 32:42.120
Your Majesty, what is your judgment?

32:46.160 --> 32:48.680
I've suspended him from office.

32:49.440 --> 32:51.960
He is to return home,
copy scriptures, and repent.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.200
Suspended?

32:56.040 --> 32:57.680
You didn't even strip him of his rank?

32:58.720 --> 33:00.720
He killed dozens in my household.

33:01.240 --> 33:02.720
He murdered Your Majesty's brother.

33:03.240 --> 33:04.840
He tried to kill me again and again.

33:05.520 --> 33:08.400
And for all that, his sentence
is to copy scriptures?

33:12.760 --> 33:14.120
He's the Right Chancellor.

33:14.840 --> 33:16.040
If I killed him outright,

33:16.640 --> 33:18.760
within three days,
the court would be in chaos.

33:18.840 --> 33:21.760
His opponents would fight to replace him.

33:22.360 --> 33:24.480
His faction would seek revenge.

33:24.560 --> 33:27.040
Everything he has
was given by Your Majesty.

33:28.280 --> 33:29.720
His opponents and his faction

33:29.800 --> 33:31.960
are also Your Majesty's subjects.

33:32.920 --> 33:34.680
By Your Majesty's reasoning,

33:35.920 --> 33:38.760
then is Great Tang of the Li family

33:39.520 --> 33:41.200
or of the Right Chancellor?

33:47.040 --> 33:49.760
I know you just found the one
who killed your parents.

33:50.280 --> 33:52.200
Grief has clouded your mind.
It is your grief speaking.

33:52.280 --> 33:54.280
I will overlook your offense.

33:55.800 --> 33:57.600
But if you overstep once more,

33:57.680 --> 34:01.400
I will show you whose court
this really is!

34:38.040 --> 34:38.880
Peiyi.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.920
Peiyi.

35:03.880 --> 35:05.240
Why wouldn't you let me kill him?

35:06.520 --> 35:07.360
Why?

35:09.080 --> 35:11.480
I don't want you to live
with the pain of killing.

35:12.280 --> 35:13.920
You're not a monster

35:14.720 --> 35:17.120
who can kill and still sleep at night.

35:17.840 --> 35:20.840
I've never known
what it feels like to sleep in peace.

35:22.000 --> 35:24.720
All I know is what it feels like
to lose everyone overnight.

35:25.560 --> 35:26.680
You don't understand anything.

35:28.000 --> 35:29.720
Why did you decide for me?

35:30.720 --> 35:32.160
You're right. I don't understand.

35:33.440 --> 35:34.960
I was just afraid you'd get hurt.

35:37.280 --> 35:38.920
But every time I worry,

35:40.360 --> 35:41.640
I end up stopping you,

35:42.240 --> 35:43.840
and it only brings you pain.

35:46.200 --> 35:48.440
You said revenge is what keeps you alive.

35:49.560 --> 35:53.240
So will every tomorrow be about revenge?

35:54.520 --> 35:55.640
And after you have it,

35:56.680 --> 35:57.960
what comes next?

36:02.280 --> 36:03.760
What can I do?

36:05.000 --> 36:06.280
Someone like me,

36:07.000 --> 36:10.680
can I still hope for some calm,

36:11.480 --> 36:13.160
happy life together?

36:14.280 --> 36:15.760
You've never hoped for it?

36:18.520 --> 36:19.760
Not once.

36:21.280 --> 36:23.880
Because I am nothing
but a curse to all around me.

36:24.920 --> 36:26.360
All I wanted was revenge.

36:27.440 --> 36:30.480
For revenge, I was ready
to make you an accomplice

36:30.560 --> 36:32.480
and to stain our wedding with blood.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.720
That's who I am.

36:35.120 --> 36:36.880
Then why did you send us all away?

36:38.080 --> 36:39.560
If it wasn't to protect us,

36:39.640 --> 36:42.600
why set such a huge trap
and keep us far from your banquet?

36:43.760 --> 36:45.360
Maybe I just thought you'd get in my way.

36:47.480 --> 36:50.760
If you hadn't rushed back,
my revenge would be done by now.

36:52.760 --> 36:53.840
In your heart,

36:56.480 --> 36:57.880
did we ever matter to you?

36:59.200 --> 37:00.840
What were our feelings?

37:01.600 --> 37:03.160
What was this imperial marriage to you?

37:04.240 --> 37:05.680
If you killed the Right Chancellor,

37:06.840 --> 37:08.080
what would I have to bear?

37:11.160 --> 37:13.680
You think I'll drag your family down.

37:15.080 --> 37:16.080
Don't worry.

37:17.000 --> 37:19.640
I did this before the wedding.

37:20.520 --> 37:23.080
You remain the spotless heir.

37:23.680 --> 37:25.680
You'll still have a bright future.

37:26.760 --> 37:27.760
I won't implicate you.

37:30.800 --> 37:32.000
So in your eyes,

37:34.640 --> 37:36.200
I'm that kind of person?

37:38.200 --> 37:40.080
You think everything I did

37:42.280 --> 37:44.800
was only to keep my family
from being dragged down?

37:48.400 --> 37:49.400
Li Peiyi,

37:52.080 --> 37:54.280
I just can't bear to lose you.

38:00.160 --> 38:01.120
But now,

38:02.880 --> 38:04.120
I guess I can take it.

38:05.880 --> 38:07.680
I ruined your revenge.

38:10.280 --> 38:12.080
You ruined my marriage.

38:13.440 --> 38:15.360
Let's call it even.

38:33.040 --> 38:34.640
Then we're even.

38:36.560 --> 38:37.560
No one owes the other.

38:38.400 --> 38:39.320
Fine.

38:40.600 --> 38:41.920
We're even.

38:43.560 --> 38:44.880
No one owes the other.

40:36.080 --> 40:37.280
Did I…

40:38.880 --> 40:39.920
do the wrong thing?

41:41.960 --> 41:43.520
It's been over half a month.

41:43.600 --> 41:44.720
Why is he still not recovering?

41:44.800 --> 41:47.120
The young master's illness
lies in the heart.

41:47.200 --> 41:50.240
Medicine can restore his body
but can't fix his heart.

42:04.200 --> 42:05.960
Your Highness, you finally came out.

42:06.040 --> 42:07.760
Are you going out?

42:07.840 --> 42:09.000
I'm going to the palace.

42:12.200 --> 42:13.480
Your Majesty, please allow me

42:13.560 --> 42:15.440
to resign
from the Palace Investigation Bureau,

42:15.520 --> 42:17.040
strip me of my princess title,

42:17.600 --> 42:19.760
and also withdraw the marriage decree.

42:21.720 --> 42:23.760
While you've shut yourself away at home,

42:24.280 --> 42:27.360
the Right Chancellor has also
been shut away, copying scriptures.

42:28.160 --> 42:29.400
Are you still sulking with me?

42:29.480 --> 42:30.640
I'm not sulking.

42:31.560 --> 42:34.440
These duties are beyond my ability.

42:34.520 --> 42:35.600
So I choose to lay them all down.

42:35.680 --> 42:39.200
VIRTUE SHINING, EVER-PROGRESSING

42:39.280 --> 42:42.240
I never liked you working
at the Palace Investigation Bureau anyway.

42:42.320 --> 42:43.160
You may quit.

42:45.600 --> 42:47.040
The court is in turmoil now.

42:47.120 --> 42:49.320
Breaking off the marriage
at a time like this

42:49.400 --> 42:50.760
may hurt the Xiao family.

42:50.840 --> 42:53.360
Besides, the Deputy Director
is ill right now.

42:54.040 --> 42:55.000
Wait a little longer.

42:58.400 --> 43:00.320
As for your princess title…

43:01.080 --> 43:03.040
You poisoned the whole court.

43:03.640 --> 43:06.760
No one died,
but it was still wildly wrong!

43:06.840 --> 43:08.760
I must punish you, or I can't calm them!

43:11.040 --> 43:12.160
Alright.

43:12.240 --> 43:13.360
You may be the County Princess once more.

43:14.800 --> 43:16.040
Thank you, Your Majesty.

43:19.280 --> 43:20.160
By the way,

43:20.760 --> 43:23.840
when you have time,
go see Consort Shu at Qinghui Palace.

43:24.440 --> 43:25.440
Qinghui Palace?

43:26.920 --> 43:28.160
The Cold Palace?

43:28.240 --> 43:30.400
She knows her brother
committed a grave wrong,

43:31.360 --> 43:34.120
so she asked to go there and reflect.

43:35.320 --> 43:36.160
When did this happen?

43:36.800 --> 43:38.280
The day you left the palace.

43:39.840 --> 43:42.360
What did she do wrong?

43:52.440 --> 43:53.280
Your Highness.

43:58.600 --> 43:59.680
You're avoiding me?

44:02.240 --> 44:05.200
My brother committed such a crime.

44:05.720 --> 44:07.800
I can't leave the palace to question him,

44:08.560 --> 44:10.320
and I don't know how to make it up to you.

44:10.840 --> 44:14.760
So I asked to come here to repent,
so you never have to see me again.

44:14.840 --> 44:18.280
Did you know about what Cui Minzhong did?

44:21.800 --> 44:23.320
If I had known,

44:24.560 --> 44:27.960
how could I have stayed with you
for all these years?

44:28.960 --> 44:32.160
When His Majesty judged the case,
did you plead for him?

44:34.040 --> 44:38.040
Such an inhuman crime
should be punished severely.

44:38.560 --> 44:40.760
Even if I were implicated, I deserve it.

44:41.440 --> 44:43.600
What right have I to plead his case?

44:44.840 --> 44:46.240
He did the killing.

44:46.880 --> 44:48.040
His Majesty passed the sentence.

44:48.680 --> 44:51.080
You knew nothing about it.

44:51.160 --> 44:54.880
And you've treated me
as your own for years.

44:54.960 --> 44:56.280
Why should you repent here?

44:58.720 --> 45:00.160
Do you regret raising me?

45:04.880 --> 45:06.480
How could I?

45:06.560 --> 45:08.440
You're my child.

45:09.440 --> 45:13.880
What mother would regret
raising her own child?

45:22.200 --> 45:23.360
Your Highness…

45:24.880 --> 45:25.880
I miss you so much.

45:29.080 --> 45:30.680
I miss you too.

45:35.080 --> 45:36.000
Peiyi…

45:37.560 --> 45:38.880
Are you…

45:40.520 --> 45:42.040
thinking of leaving?

45:46.360 --> 45:47.640
Where would you have me go?

45:49.200 --> 45:52.880
Are you thinking of leaving the palace,
leaving the capital?

45:53.760 --> 45:54.920
You're sending me away?

45:56.680 --> 45:57.920
Of course not.

45:58.920 --> 45:59.920
I'm just afraid…

46:01.280 --> 46:02.480
I'm afraid you'll…

46:04.480 --> 46:07.760
Now, I'm all you have left.

46:10.200 --> 46:11.400
And you're all I have left too.

46:12.240 --> 46:14.600
I'm not going anywhere.
I'll stay with you.
